          "start": 5284,
          "end": 5652,
          "text": "You’ll receive a notification about the success of your application in this first round. If you have not been selected for the next round, you’ll receive short feedback from the Committee.\nStep 3: External review\nTo assist our Fellowships and Grants Committee with the selection procedure, at least three external reviewers will review the project proposal in detail. ",
